# Contact form endpoint — Stage 7.
#
# Create a form at https://formspree.io, then put its endpoint here and
# redeploy. Without it the form validates but will not claim to send:
# in dev it simulates the round-trip, in production the submit button is
# disabled and the email link beside it is the working path.
#
# This value is not a secret (it is a public POST target), but it is
# deploy-time config, so it does not belong in the repo.
VITE_FORM_ENDPOINT=
